---
title: Alic's Cranberry Dish
image: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/39/db/34/39db34dd5516c258514cb1a8c7c2a95f.jpg
---

Strain the liquid from your canned @mandarin oranges{1%can}(diced) into a #sauce pan{}.

Add @sugar{1%cup} and @cranberries{1%16 oz bag}.

Heat on medium until the cranberries have popped.

Add the mandarin oranges, @walnuts{3/4%cup}(chopped), and @apple{1}(Granny Smith, chopped).

Continue heating until the ingredients have softened, about ~{5-10%minutes}.